  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of workers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In recent years, Lebanon has grappled with a complex intertwining of social, economic, and political challenges, creating a multi-faceted crisis that has deeply impacted all its citizens, in specific workers and their families. 
During the biennium, ILO interventions will continue its support for the workers&#x2019; organizations in Lebanon to influence the socio-economic policies to expand social protection and reform the labour law in line with International Labour Standards . In addition, ILO will support the Lebanese Trade Union to enhance and engage in collective bargaining and social dialogue processes to secure decent work for all workers in Lebanon.</narrative>
  </description>
